# SCOPE: this allowlist covers ONLY the packages inside the mutation gate scope
# (see MUTATE_EXCLUDE in the Makefile): internal/db, internal/model and
# internal/config. Mutations outside that scope are not run at all, so they can
# never appear here.
#
# Format:  <MUTATOR> <file>:<line>
#
